GPS Waypoints Lite is a surveying application for iOS devices that enables smartphones' users to collect and classify Points and to become map creators. This multi-purpose solution, with an easy-to-use interface, is adequate for both professional activities (such as earth sciences surveying) and personal activities (outdoor and tourism).

The GPS Wpts Lite version includes the following features:
- View current position with accuracy and navigation information;
- Create Points with accuracy information and classify them with Tags;
- Get directions and distances from current position to existing Points using the magnetic or gps compass;
- View on Maps the geodata (existing points on the database);
- Import Points from CSV, KML and Geojson files using geographic coordinates (Lat, Long in wgs84);
- Export Points to CSV, GPX and Geojson files by saving data locally or sharing with other applications (e.g. Mail, iCloud/Dropbox/Google Drive);
- Create and use survey's Themes with custom Tags for classifying Points; 
– Backup and restore your data.

Miio app allows you to comfortably charge your electric vehicle in Portugal, France and Spain, get to know the final price beforehand and interact with the community. 

Miio makes it possible to:
- Charge your vehicle through the app or physical card;
- Have full control over your expenses, before, during and after your charging session;
- View the most complete charging station map, with power indicators, plug availability and type of venue;
- Get help to choose between charging stations and plugs, according to your vehicle specificities;
- Monitor your charging session from distance and in real time, with smart alarms; 
- Comment, rate and add photos to charging stations;
- Be notified about state and price changes, or about new stations; 
- Save your favorite or recent charging stations;
- Plan your trips: where to stop and charge, how long it will take and how much it will cost you;
- Earn bonus with our campaigns;
And much more!
